+  it; their expected values hold.
+- A Value Scaling move. The travelled fraction can magnify rounding beyond τ.
+  The moves in cases MIDI-CONFIG-129, 133, 137, 138, 143 to 145, 153, 155 and
+  161, all with a smaller bound of 0, lie within τ of the exact rule; their
+  expected values hold.
